.TH "JSONKIT\-MCP" "1" "" "jsonkit 0.0.0" ""
.SH "NAME"
jsonkit\-mcp \- Serve this application\(aqs tools to an MCP client over stdin and stdout.
.SH "SYNOPSIS"
.nf
\fBjsonkit mcp\fR [options]
\fBjsonkit mcp\fR <command> [options]
.fi
.SH "COMMANDS"
.TP
\fBinstall\fR
Register this application\(aqs MCP server with your coding agents.
.TP
\fBuninstall\fR
Remove this application\(aqs MCP server from your coding agents.
.TP
\fBconfig\fR
Print a client configuration that starts this application\(aqs MCP server.
.SH "SEE ALSO"
\fBjsonkit\fR(1), \fBjsonkit\-mcp\-install\fR(1), \fBjsonkit\-mcp\-uninstall\fR(1), \fBjsonkit\-mcp\-config\fR(1)
